{"title":"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video(By_YippieMath)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video(By YippieMath)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The diagram shows the miles traveled by bikers Alberto and Bjorn. After four hours, about how many more miles has Alberto biked than Bjorn?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07bfc35302b906872d0fbe29df5e4d23b2a658d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for (int a = 0; a &lt; 6; ++a) { for (int b = 0; b &lt; 6; ++b) { dot((4*a,3*b)); } } draw((0,0)--(20,0)--(20,15)--(0,15)--cycle); draw((0,0)--(16,12)); draw((0,0)--(16,9));  label(rotate(30)*&quot;Bjorn&quot;,(12,6.75),SE); label(rotate(37)*&quot;Alberto&quot;,(11,8.25),NW);  label(&quot;$0$&quot;,(0,0),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(8,0),S); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(12,0),S); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(16,0),S); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(20,0),S); label(&quot;$0$&quot;,(0,0),W); label(&quot;$15$&quot;,(0,3),W); label(&quot;$30$&quot;,(0,6),W); label(&quot;$45$&quot;,(0,9),W); label(&quot;$60$&quot;,(0,12),W); label(&quot;$75$&quot;,(0,15),W);  label(&quot;H&quot;,(6,-2),S); label(&quot;O&quot;,(8,-2),S); label(&quot;U&quot;,(10,-2),S); label(&quot;R&quot;,(12,-2),S); label(&quot;S&quot;,(14,-2),S);  label(&quot;M&quot;,(-4,11),N); label(&quot;I&quot;,(-4,9),N); label(&quot;L&quot;,(-4,7),N); label(&quot;E&quot;,(-4,5),N); label(&quot;S&quot;,(-4,3),N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"195\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/a/73a444950c366de9f08f0b79a44a50c9908c7f34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 25 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After 4 hours, we see that Bjorn biked 45 miles, and Alberto biked 60.  Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/beff3ff1029f4a8e5beb9e5c8e8eb5e6b85501b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60-45=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c1c9d1b1e9b85d185f077bab73eb0531dd6f2e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"37\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that each dot is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units away from the nearest one above it. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video.28By_YippieMath.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video(By_YippieMath)\">Video(By YippieMath)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video(By YippieMath)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOgTEjyBk0s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOgTEjyBk0s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" col